===Noun===
'''antilogarithm'''  (abbreviated as ''antilog'') (''plural:'' [[antilogarithms]])

# {{mathematics}} the [[number]] of which a given number is the [[logarithm]]
#:Thus, if ''x'' = log ''y'', then ''y'' is the antilog of ''x''

